        {
            "content": "Okay, so I'm gonna explain our pricing works. Our probably super simple. I can send you an email if you'd like so you don't have to take notes, we charge an hourly rate it is a little very on the day of the week, but pretty much outside of packing materials everything's included in that rates and it's just contingent on the crew size. So, for the date you requested at least Monday seer fourteenth, it'd be $102 per hour, $102 per hour per mover. We'd send at least a three man team. If it's a full pack of move even though you're going just across the street and I'll explain more about that in a second. But if it was a three man team just for perspective it just be the $102 per hour per mover times three which would be $306 per hour and then that just covers gonna cover the time it takes to complete the job. The pack either if it's cross street it's kind of in between, likely depending on how much there's the move.",
